  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 402.01 Limitations on Percentage of Baseline for Class A Major Sources. Pursuant to RSA 125-D:3, I(b), unless otherwise authorized by RSA 125-D:3, I(f) relative to 2 or more sources under a single ownership, the annual SO2 emissions from each class A major source shall not exceed 75 percent of such source’s portion of the baseline emissions.\n\nSource. #120, eff 8-31-73; ss by #721.5, eff 12-7-75; ss by #718, eff 12-7-75; ss by #1717, eff 2-19-81; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by #2938, eff 12-27-84; ss by #5033, eff 12-27-90; EXPIRED 12-27-96\n\nNew. #6424, INTERIM, eff 1-9-97, EXPIRES 5-9-97; ss and moved by #6469-B, eff 3-5-97 (from Env-A 406); ss and moved by #8233, eff 12-22-04 (from Env-A 403.01); ss by #10288, eff 3-19-13; ss by #13641, eff 5-23-23",
